<title>USA: Landmark Bancshares to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Landmark Bancshares to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY, Kan. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Landmark Bancshares Corp said it intends to repurchase up to 473,316 shares, or 15 percent, of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>Repurchased shares will be used for general corporate purposes, including issuance of shares in connection with exercise of stock options and other company and bank stock benefit plans, the bank holding company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
